OL,3,GNEWSAMonster trail takes over town
OL,4,Acentre for Halloween
OL,5,
OL,6,FA town centre in Kent has been taken
OL,7,Fover by monsters for the half-term
OL,8,Fholidays.
OL,10,FMaidstone's Monster Mash, organised by
OL,11,FOne Maidstone BID and Maidstone Borough
OL,12,FCouncil, will see a collection of giant
OL,13,Finflatable monsters at prominent
OL,14,Flocations throughout the town.
OL,16,FThe mayor, Councillor Brian Clark, is
OL,17,Fhoping that people of all ages will
OL,18,Fenjoy the display.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
