OL,3,GNEWSAMonster trail takes over town
OL,4,Acentre for Halloween
OL,5,
OL,6,F"This is an amazing event coinciding
OL,7,Fwith Halloween and we want to encourage
OL,8,Fpeople to come to the town for this
OL,9,Ffree event with six giant monsters
OL,10,Fspread around the businesses and
OL,11,Fbuildings," he said.
